# Synthetic phase-3 spike images are regenerable (scripts/make-image-fixtures.mjs).
# The glob is non-recursive (no **), so fixtures/image-regions/real/*.png stays
# tracked - those are crops pulled from the benchmark deck, not regenerable.
# labels.json (ground truth for the synthetic images) is also always tracked.
fixtures/image-regions/*.png
~$*
